World Legal Bench v1.4.1-release

License scope

- MIT: src/, scripts/, tests/, examples/*.py, pyproject.toml, and executable configuration.
- CC BY 4.0: original authored data/ and provenance/ annotations, Markdown documentation,
  schemas, and original assets, to the extent the contributors hold the relevant rights.
- Third-party material: referenced laws, judgments, provision titles, and quotations
  retain their existing rights status. No ownership of official source material,
  endorsement by a government, or authority to relicense third-party material is claimed.

The dataset distributes official source references and available digests, rather
than bulk official legal source texts. Some questions and rationales refer to or
quote legal terms. Source URLs and locators are provided for attribution and review.

The deterministic final-answer parser is extracted from the evaluation implementation
used for this dataset release. It is distributed as standalone code under MIT.

The benchmark is an evaluation artifact, not legal advice. AI-assisted source quick
checks are not independent legal-expert certification.
